on one another in that order. Unknown/empty/duplicate filters:400; unknown IDs or non-retained periods:404; failed selected retrieval/representation:503. A successful source can contain unavailable observations.","missingness":"Zero is not missing; a nonpositive CPI index fails validation as anomalous. Dash+X is unavailable, plain dash missing. Suppressed requires explicit publisher evidence and review; currently unsupported by this reader. Failed retrieval has no fabricated observations.","times":"Monthly observation period is separate from publication and retrieval times. Unknown release times remain null. No daily-change staleness rule.","revisits":"Observation versions include value, dimensions, period, state, footnotes and attribution, not retrieval times or unrelated source-file changes. Same ID/new version means changed observation or qualifications, requiring publisher evidence to classify. File-level provenance can change the response ETag without changing any observation. Failures never return 304.","citations":"Cite exact observation URL/version, publisher URL, reference month, NSA and base. Retain the response for historical audit; rolling URLs are not permanent vintage archives.","comparisons":"One national urban CPI-U series and 13 calendar slots, including unavailable months. Exact retained periods only; no state/DC-only data, other CPI definitions, annual averages, arbitrary history, inferred contract terms or substitute months."}}